WHY THIS LICENCE

A specification that cannot be quoted, translated or forked is not a specification, it
is a brochure. Attribution-only was chosen deliberately over ShareAlike (which would be
viral into other documents that quote it) and over NoDerivatives (which would prevent
forking, and forking is the entire point of publishing a draft).

If a standards body later wishes to adopt this text as the basis for its own work, this
licence is intended not to be an obstacle.

